// Model Type: ALL IN ONE
// Simulator: TINA
// Simulator Version: 9.1.30.94 SF -TI
// EVM Order Number: N/A
// EVM Users Guide: N/A
// Datasheet: SLOS270D - MARCH 2001 - REVISED JANUARY 2005
//
